sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant PR as AniWereProbe<br/>(Sepolia)
    participant AV as Aave V3 Pool
    participant W as Worker
    participant PC as Block Prover<br/>Precompile
    participant ASC as AniWereASC<br/>(Creditcoin)

    U->>FE: Connect wallet
    FE->>PR: probe(user)
    Note over U,PR: User approve tx di Sepolia
    PR->>AV: getUserAccountData(user)
    AV-->>PR: collateral, debt, healthFactor
    PR->>PR: emit PositionProbedForCover

    Note over PR,W: Tunggu block sumber ter-attest (~8 menit).<br/>BUKAN menunggu finality Ethereum — attestation berjalan di depannya.

    W->>W: Deteksi event via eth_getLogs
    W->>W: Polling sampai block ter-attest di Creditcoin
    W->>W: Generate continuity proof + merkle proof
    W->>ASC: submitPositionProof(rawTx, merkle, continuity)

    rect rgb(230, 245, 233)
    Note over ASC,PC: SATU transaksi Creditcoin (~15 detik)
    ASC->>PC: verifikasi proof
    alt Proof valid
        PC-->>ASC: transaksi terverifikasi
        ASC->>ASC: decode event, simpan Snapshot
    else Proof palsu
        PC-->>ASC: REVERT
    end
    end

    ASC-->>FE: Snapshot verified + block number
    FE-->>U: Tampilkan HF terverifikasi

    U->>ASC: buyCover(coverAmount, duration) + premi
    ASC->>ASC: Cek solvency, kunci modal, simpan Policy
    ASC-->>U: Policy aktif
